============================================================================================
0. HOW CLUSTERED IS THIS CORPUS? (a second, independent estimate)
============================================================================================
  7557 files in 2103 replication packages, mean cluster size 3.59
  ICC of the per-file outcome within a package = 0.251
  design effect 1.65 -> effective n 4577, not 7557
  For comparison, measured on a completely different corpus (Jupyter
  notebooks inside GitHub repositories, Samuel & Mietchen 2021 run):
  ICC = 0.435. Two languages, two repositories, two research communities.
  Every file-level percentage in this literature needs this correction and
  none applies it. All z statistics below are divided by sqrt(deff).

